#### APP SUMMARY ON 8/26/25 ####

Coin Tracker App - Current State Summary
Architecture & Tech Stack

Framework: Streamlit (Python)
Database: SQLite everywhere (local + cloud via embedded file)
Deployment: Streamlit Cloud with SQLite file committed to GitHub repo
Structure: Multi-page app with 13+ pages including Dashboard, Inventory, Admin, etc.

Recent Major Refactoring (Completed)

Database Layer: Completely refactored from monolithic 600+ line queries.py into modular architecture

db.py - SQLite connection handling
db_operations.py - Generic database operations (execute_query_*, upsert_record, etc.)
query_builders.py - SQL building utilities (WhereClauseBuilder, etc.)
business_logic.py - Transaction processing, cost allocation (TransactionBuilder class)
dashboard_helpers.py - Dashboard-specific data processing functions
constants.py - Centralized constants (navigation, silver coin specs, column configs)


Database Migration: Successfully moved from Turso (cloud PostgreSQL) back to SQLite everywhere for simplicity
Admin Page: Fully refactored from direct SQL to proper function calls
Compatibility Layer: Temporary shims in queries.py for old function names

Key Features Implemented

Coin master & type management with NGC/PCGS URL fields (recently added)
Transaction processing (BUY/SELL with FIFO inventory tracking)
Multi-tab dashboard with portfolio summary, metal prices, series rollups
Data import functionality (CSV uploads for coin masters, types, transactions)
Admin interface for all CRUD operations
Silver melt value calculator with configurable coin specifications

Current Data Schema

Full relational schema with coin_master, coin_type, transactions, lots, inventory tracking
Includes bullion support, specimen tracking, metal pricing, guide pricing
Complex view system for inventory valuation (melt, numismatic, manual methods)

Testing Status

✅ Local SQLite: All core functionality working
✅ Cloud SQLite: All core functionality working
✅ Data Import: Coin masters, coin types, transactions all working
✅ Admin Operations: Add/edit coin masters and types working
✅ Transactions: Creation, viewing, voiding all working

Known Issues & Cleanup Needed

